	"note": "Design map (M13.0). The new part of Liscor's dungeon under the rift, reached by ropes hanging from a hole in the ceiling (4.08 T, 4.19). The rooms come from the text: the rope landing, a corridor of glowing runes and a pit with stone spikes (4.08 T), a room whose ceiling spikes drop, a library of books that explode when read and a grate that sprays acid (4.19), and a shaft full of Shield Spider webs (4.08 T). In the Book the rooms change on each visit; here they stay put. The order, sizes and the stairs down to the crypt level are guesses. The ropes open with liscor_dungeon.new_section_found.",
